    "chunk_text": "& he & he him brohte \u00fea lac. \u00c6fter heora spr\u00e6ce cw\u00e6\u00fe se Aoth him to: Eala \u00feu Engol cining. Ic h\u00e6bbe \u00fee to secganne ures Godes \u00e6rende; uton gan onsundron; & hig sona eodon in to sumum \u00d0a abr\u00e6d Aoth bealdlice his swurd mid his wynstran handa & hine hetelice \u00feidde, swa \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea hiltan Englon se cining l\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6r swa dead. & Aoth bleow bealdlice his horn & ferde mid fultume to gefeohte sona, & ofsloh tyn \u00f0usend & he \u00fea Moabiscan miclum geeadmette & hi under\u00feeodde his agenum \u00feeowte, & heora land \u00fea w\u00e6s \u00c6FTER Aothes for\u00f0si\u00f0e hi geeacnodon eft heora unrihtwisnysse & heora yfel ongean God. & he hig \u00fea bet\u00e6hte sumum gramlican cininge, Iabin gehaten. And he h\u00e6fde heora geweald ealles twentig geara, & hig yfele ofsette; & hig \u00fea clipodon on hira \u00d0a asende him God sumne heretogan to, Barac gehaten, & he \u00fea ferde mid tyn \u00feusend mannum to Hw\u00e6t \u00fea se Barac, gebyld swi\u00f0e \u00feurh God, feaht him togeanes mid his fyrde swi\u00f0e. & God \u00fea af\u00e6rde \u00feone fors\u00e6dan ealdorman & ealle his meniu, \u00f0\u00e6t hig mihtlease flugon, & hig man & Sesirra arn of his agenum cr\u00e6te fram ealre \u00fe\u00e6re fyrde, geegsod \u00feurh God, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he werig becom & heo cw\u00e6\u00fe to him: Gang in, la leof, to urum getelde, ne ondr\u00e6d \u00fee nan \u00feing; He eode",
